# Chat language

- Replies in the chat, and any question asked back to the user, are written in Arabic.
- Written artifacts stay English-only: specs and plans under `docs/superpowers/`, architecture notes, `DESIGN.md`, and any `README`. Code, identifiers, and commit messages also stay English.
